<acceptance_gate>
Interface draft. Generation is not accepted until the team approves formula definitions, required inputs, units, rounding, and versions as a reviewed registry artifact, and one golden contract test exists per approved formula. Contract tests exercise the evaluator with clearly labeled arithmetic fixtures (`fixture_*` calculation types); they encode no real financial formula, rate, cost, incentive, or return.
</acceptance_gate>

